  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.1: Bug fixes — LicenseHandlingUninstall reads from disk (not install chain); LicenseSignatureValidationHandler now correctly distinguishes tampered files from key rotation (throws CryptographicException on tamper). 3.0.0: Audit-driven hardening release. Centralized HTTP plumbing (15s timeout, retry-with-backoff for 429/503, Retry-After honoring, Idempotency-Key on POST, X-Correlation-Id, RFC 7807 problem+json error parsing). Hardened XML signature validation (XmlResolver=null, public-key shape check). Typed exceptions instead of base Exception. ILicenseLogger interface for observability. PublisherPreferences.ToString() masks ApiKey. ConfigureAwait(false) applied consistently. Several public infrastructure types are now internal (LicenseValidationHandler, *ApiEndPoint, MainRegistryKeyIn*, NullDeviceIdFormatter). See CHANGELOG.md for full list.",
